docs {
  # Get Cable TV Packages
  
  Use this endpoint after the user selects a provider.
  
  Query:
  
  `provider`
  Required. Use `DSTV`, `GOTV`, or `STARTIMES`.
  
  The backend returns enabled packages from the saved BillXpress catalogue.
  Admin must sync VTpass packages, set prices, and enable packages before they
  appear here.
  
  Normal users receive `ourPrice` context when a fixed user price exists.
  Active vendors/API users receive vendor pricing through the vendor API.
  
  Send package `id` or `code` as `packageCode` when quoting or purchasing.
}
